{"id":"restaurant","lv":"N5","place":{"jp":"レストラン","en":"At a restaurant","fr":"Au restaurant"},"them":{"en":"Staff","fr":"Serveur"},"turns":[{"them":{"rows":[["いらっしゃいませ","v","irasshaimase"],["。"],["何名","w","nanmei",[["何","なん"],["名","めい"]]],["様","w","sama",[["様","さま"]]],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Welcome! How many people?","fr":"Bienvenue ! Combien de personnes ?"},"choices":[[["二人","w","futari",[["二","ふた"],["人","り"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["二つ","w","futatsu",[["二","ふた"],["つ",""]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["二回","w","nikai",[["二","に"],["回","かい"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Two people.","fr":"Deux personnes."},"why":{"en":"人 counts people (二人, ふたり). つ counts things, 回 counts times.","fr":"人 compte les personnes (二人, ふたり). つ compte les choses, 回 les fois."}},{"them":{"rows":[["お飲み物","w","onomimono",[["お",""],["飲","の"],["み",""],["物","もの"]]],["は","p","wa"],["何","w","nani",[["何","なに"]]],["に","p","ni"],["します","v","shimasu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"What would you like to drink?","fr":"Que voulez-vous boire ?"},"choices":[[["水","w","mizu",[["水","みず"]]],["を","p","o"],["お願い","v","onegai",[["お",""],["願","ねが"],["い",""]]],["します","v","shimasu"],["。"]],[["水","w","mizu",[["水","みず"]]],["が","p","ga"],["います","v","imasu"],["。"]],[["水","w","mizu",[["水","みず"]]],["で","p","de"],["行きます","v","ikimasu",[["行","い"],["きます",""]]],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Water, please.","fr":"De l'eau, s'il vous plaît."},"why":{"en":"〜をお願いします asks for something. います is for people and animals, and 水で行きます would be “I go by water”.","fr":"〜をお願いします demande quelque chose. います sert pour les personnes et les animaux, et 水で行きます serait « j'y vais par l'eau »."}},{"them":{"rows":[["ご注文","w","gochuumon",[["ご",""],["注","ちゅう"],["文","もん"]]],["は","p","wa"],["お決まり","v","okimari",[["お",""],["決","き"],["まり",""]]],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Are you ready to order?","fr":"Vous avez choisi ?"},"choices":[[["ラーメン","w","raamen"],["を","p","o"],["一つ","w","hit