{"id":"intro","lv":"N5","place":{"jp":"自己紹介","en":"Meeting someone","fr":"Une rencontre"},"them":{"en":"Tanaka","fr":"Tanaka"},"turns":[{"them":{"rows":[["はじめまして","v","hajimemashite"],["。"],["田中","w","tanaka",[["田","た"],["中","なか"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],"en":"Nice to meet you. I'm Tanaka.","fr":"Enchanté. Je m'appelle Tanaka."},"choices":[[["はじめまして","v","hajimemashite"],["。"],["マリー","w","marii"],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["いただきます","v","itadakimasu"],["。"]],[["おやすみ","v","oyasumi"],["なさい","v","nasai"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Nice to meet you. I'm Marie.","fr":"Enchantée. Je m'appelle Marie."},"why":{"en":"はじめまして answers はじめまして, the first time you meet. いただきます is said before eating, おやすみなさい before sleeping.","fr":"はじめまして répond à はじめまして, la première fois qu'on se voit. いただきます se dit avant de manger, おやすみなさい avant de dormir."}},{"them":{"rows":[["マリー","w","marii"],["さん","w","san"],["は","p","wa"],["どこ","w","doko"],["から","p","kara"],["来ました","v","kimashita",[["来","き"],["ました",""]]],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Where are you from, Marie?","fr":"D'où venez-vous, Marie ?"},"choices":[[["フランス","w","furansu"],["から","p","kara"],["来ました","v","kimashita",[["来","き"],["ました",""]]],["。"]],[["フランス","w","furansu"],["へ","p","e"],["来ました","v","kimashita",[["来","き"],["ました",""]]],["。"]],[["フランス","w","furansu"],["で","p","de"],["来ました","v","kimashita",[["来","き"],["ました",""]]],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"I'm from France.","fr":"Je viens de France."},"why":{"en":"から marks where you come from. へ is where you go, and で where something happens.","fr":"から marque d'où l'on vient. へ marque où l'on va, et で où quelque chose se passe."}},{"them":{"rows":[["日本語","w","nihongo",[["日本語","にほんご"]]],["が","p","ga"],["上手","w","jouzu",[["上","じょう"],["手","ず"]]],["です","c","desu"],["ね","p","ne"],["。"]],"en":"Your Japanese is good!","fr":"Votre japonais est bon !"},"choices":[[["いいえ","w","iie"],["、"],["まだまだ","w","madamada"],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["はい","w","hai"],["、"],["上手","w","jouzu",[["上","じょう"],["