{"id":"konbini","lv":"N4","place":{"jp":"コンビニ","en":"At a convenience store","fr":"À la supérette"},"them":{"en":"Cashier","fr":"Caissier"},"turns":[{"them":{"rows":[["袋","w","fukuro",[["袋","ふくろ"]]],["はいります","v","hairimasu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Do you need a bag?","fr":"Il vous faut un sac ?"},"choices":[[["いいえ","w","iie"],["、"],["大丈夫","w","daijoubu",[["大","だい"],["丈","じょう"],["夫","ぶ"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["袋","w","fukuro",[["袋","ふくろ"]]],["が","p","ga"],["います","v","imasu"],["。"]],[["はい","w","hai"],["、"],["袋","w","fukuro",[["袋","ふくろ"]]],["でし","c","deshi"],["た","w","ta"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"No, I'm fine, thanks.","fr":"Non, ça ira, merci."},"why":{"en":"大丈夫です politely says no thanks. いる “to need” is not いる “to be”: 袋がいます would make the bag alive.","fr":"大丈夫です refuse poliment. いる « avoir besoin » n'est pas いる « être là » : 袋がいます ferait du sac un être vivant."}},{"them":{"rows":[["お箸","w","ohashi",[["お",""],["箸","はし"]]],["は","p","wa"],["おつけ","v","otsuke"],["します","v","shimasu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Shall I put in chopsticks?","fr":"Je vous mets des baguettes ?"},"choices":[[["はい","w","hai"],["、"],["お願い","v","onegai",[["お",""],["願","ねが"],["い",""]]],["します","v","shimasu"],["。"]],[["はい","w","hai"],["、"],["いただきます","v","itadakimasu"],["。"]],[["はい","w","hai"],["、"],["ごちそう","w","gochisou"],["さま","w","sama"],["でし","c","deshi"],["た","w","ta"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Yes, please.","fr":"Oui, s'il vous plaît."},"why":{"en":"お願いします accepts an offer. いただきます is said before eating, ごちそうさまでした after.","fr":"お願いします accepte une offre. いただきます se dit avant de manger, ごちそうさまでした après."}},{"them":{"rows":[["五百円","w","gohyakuen",[["五","ご"],["百","ひゃく"],["円","えん"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],"en":"That's 500 yen.","fr":"Ça fait 500 yens."},"choices":[[["カード","w","kaado"],["で","p","de"],["払えます","v","haraemasu",[["払","はら"],["えます",""]]],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["カード","w","kaado"],["を","p","o"],["払えます","v","haraemasu",[["払","はら"],["えます",""]]],["か","p","ka"],["。"