{"id":"directions","lv":"N5","place":{"jp":"道で","en":"Asking the way","fr":"Demander son chemin"},"them":{"en":"Passer-by","fr":"Passant"},"turns":[{"them":{"rows":[["大丈夫","w","daijoubu",[["大","だい"],["丈","じょう"],["夫","ぶ"]]],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Are you all right?","fr":"Ça va ?"},"choices":[[["駅","w","eki",[["駅","えき"]]],["は","p","wa"],["どこ","w","doko"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["駅","w","eki",[["駅","えき"]]],["は","p","wa"],["だれ","w","dare"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["駅","w","eki",[["駅","えき"]]],["は","p","wa"],["いつ","w","itsu"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Where is the station?","fr":"Où est la gare ?"},"why":{"en":"どこ asks where. だれ asks who, いつ asks when.","fr":"どこ demande où. だれ demande qui, いつ demande quand."}},{"them":{"rows":[["まっすぐ","w","massugu"],["行って","v","itte",[["行","い"],["って",""]]],["、"],["二つ","w","futatsu",[["二","ふた"],["つ",""]]],["目","w","me",[["目","め"]]],["の","p","no"],["角","w","kado",[["角","かど"]]],["を","p","o"],["右","w","migi",[["右","みぎ"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],"en":"Go straight, then right at the second corner.","fr":"Allez tout droit, puis à droite au deuxième coin."},"choices":[[["ありがとう","w","arigatou"],["ございます","v","gozaimasu"],["。"]],[["いただきます","v","itadakimasu"],["。"]],[["おかえり","v","okaeri"],["なさい","v","nasai"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Thank you.","fr":"Merci."},"why":{"en":"ありがとうございます thanks someone for their help. いただきます is said before eating, おかえりなさい to welcome someone home.","fr":"ありがとうございます remercie de l'aide. いただきます se dit avant de manger, おかえりなさい pour accueillir quelqu'un qui rentre."}},{"them":{"rows":[["歩いて","v","aruite",[["歩","ある"],["いて",""]]],["五分","w","gofun",[["五","ご"],["分","ふん"]]],["ぐらい","p","gurai"],["です","c","desu"],["よ","p","yo"],["。"]],"en":"It's about five minutes on foot.","fr":"C'est à environ cinq minutes à pied."},"choices":[[["近い","v","chikai",[["近","ちか"],["い",""]]],["です","c","desu"],["ね","p","ne"],["。"]],[["遠い","v","tooi"