{"id":"hotel","lv":"N4","place":{"jp":"ホテル","en":"At a hotel","fr":"À l'hôtel"},"them":{"en":"Front desk","fr":"Réception"},"turns":[{"them":{"rows":[["いらっしゃいませ","v","irasshaimase"],["。"],["ご予約","w","goyoyaku",[["ご",""],["予","よ"],["約","やく"]]],["は","p","wa"],["あります","v","arimasu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Welcome. Do you have a reservation?","fr":"Bienvenue. Vous avez une réservation ?"},"choices":[[["マリー","w","marii"],["の","p","no"],["名前","w","namae",[["名","な"],["前","まえ"]]],["で","p","de"],["予約","w","yoyaku",[["予","よ"],["約","やく"]]],["しました","v","shimashita"],["。"]],[["マリー","w","marii"],["に","p","ni"],["予約","w","yoyaku",[["予","よ"],["約","やく"]]],["しました","v","shimashita"],["。"]],[["マリー","w","marii"],["を","p","o"],["予約","w","yoyaku",[["予","よ"],["約","やく"]]],["しました","v","shimashita"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"I booked under the name Marie.","fr":"J'ai réservé au nom de Marie."},"why":{"en":"〜の名前で: “under the name of”. マリーを予約しました would book Marie herself.","fr":"〜の名前で : « au nom de ». マリーを予約しました réserverait Marie elle-même."}},{"them":{"rows":[["何","w","nan",[["何","なん"]]],["泊","w","paku",[["泊","ぱく"]]],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"How many nights?","fr":"Combien de nuits ?"},"choices":[[["二","w","ni",[["二","に"]]],["泊","w","haku",[["泊","はく"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["二人","w","futari",[["二","ふた"],["人","り"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],[["二時","w","niji",[["二","に"],["時","じ"]]],["です","c","desu"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Two nights.","fr":"Deux nuits."},"why":{"en":"泊 counts nights. 人 counts people, 時 gives the hour.","fr":"泊 compte les nuits. 人 compte les personnes, 時 donne l'heure."}},{"them":{"rows":[["朝ごはん","w","asagohan",[["朝","あさ"],["ごはん",""]]],["は","p","wa"],["七時","w","shichiji",[["七","しち"],["時","じ"]]],["から","p","kara"],["です","c","desu"],["。"]],"en":"Breakfast is from seven.","fr":"Le petit déjeuner est à partir de sept heures."},"choices":[[["何時","w","nanji",[["何","なん"],["時","じ"]]],["まで","p","made"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["何時","w","nanji",[["何","なん"],["時","じ"]]],["から","p","kara"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["どこ","w","doko"],["から","p","kara"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Until what time?","fr":"Jusqu'à quelle heure ?"},"why":{"en":"You were just told the start (から): ask the end, まで. 何時からですか asks again what you just heard.","fr":"On vient de vous dire le début (から) : demandez la fin, まで. 何時からですか redemande ce qu'on vient d'entendre."}}]},
{"id":"invite","lv":"N4","place":{"jp":"お誘い","en":"An invitation","fr":"Une invitation"},"them":{"en":"Friend","fr":"Ami"},"turns":[{"them":{"rows":[["土曜日","w","doyoubi",[["土","ど"],["曜","よう"],["日","び"]]],["、"],["映画","w","eiga",[["映","えい"],["画","が"]]],["を","p","o"],["見","v","mi",[["見","み"]]],["に","p","ni"],["行きません","v","ikimasen",[["行","い"],["きません",""]]],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"Would you like to see a movie on Saturday?","fr":"Ça te dirait d'aller voir un film samedi ?"},"choices":[[["いい","v","ii"],["です","c","desu"],["ね","p","ne"],["。"],["行きましょう","v","ikimashou",[["行","い"],["きましょう",""]]],["。"]],[["いいえ","w","iie"],["、"],["見ません","v","mimasen",[["見","み"],["ません",""]]],["。"]],[["はい","w","hai"],["、"],["行きません","v","ikimasen",[["行","い"],["きません",""]]],["でし","c","deshi"],["た","w","ta"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"Sounds good. Let's go.","fr":"Bonne idée. Allons-y."},"why":{"en":"〜ませんか invites; いいですね accepts warmly. いいえ、見ません is a cold refusal, and 行きませんでした says you did not go.","fr":"〜ませんか invite ; いいですね accepte avec plaisir. いいえ、見ません est un refus sec, et 行きませんでした dit que vous n'y êtes pas allé."}},{"them":{"rows":[["何時","w","nanji",[["何","なん"],["時","じ"]]],["に","p","ni"],["会いましょう","v","aimashou",[["会","あ"],["いましょう",""]]],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],"en":"What time shall we meet?","fr":"On se retrouve à quelle heure ?"},"choices":[[["三時","w","sanji",[["三","さん"],["時","じ"]]],["は","p","wa"],["どう","w","dou"],["です","c","desu"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["三時","w","sanji",[["三","さん"],["時","じ"]]],["でし","c","deshi"],["た","w","ta"],["か","p","ka"],["。"]],[["三時","w","sanji",[["三","さん"],["時","じ"]]],["に","p","ni"],["いました","v","imashita"],["。"]]],"right":0,"reply":{"en":"How about three?","fr":"Trois heures, ça te va ?"},"why":{"en":"〜はどうですか suggests. でしたか asks what it was, and いました says where you were.","fr":"〜はどうですか propose. でしたか demande ce que c'était, et いました dit où vous étiez."}},{"them":{"rows":[["じゃ","w","ja"],["、"],["駅","w","eki",[["駅","えき"]]],["の","p","no"],["前","w","mae",[["前","まえ"]]